{"time": "20261117T172007Z", "think": "Quest is complete; record what I know.", "command": "answer 1. The quest is done: the cellar of Fort Chalkmoth is held shut by the order, Hist sap jars marked with Jal-Veesa knot are stacked by the stair though the fort has no Hist, and something moans behind the locked door. Never-Writes-Twice keeps the key, and she dismissed it earlier. 2. Return to the hunt for the seal-stones: Bell Station near Lilmoth to learn which drowned tower is marked. 3. Go to Bell Station by boat from Lilmoth; or try to learn more about the cellar later, e.g. ask Never-Writes-Twice or pick the lock. 4. I do not know who is held in the cellar or why the order feeds them sap; I might ask Never-Writes-Twice or Jal-Veesa tree-minder.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 91, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topi