{"time": "20261117T172011Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer Notes: I entered Fort Chalkmoth unseen via the yard trapdoor, which leads to the cellar guardroom. Captain Sakeeus-Wan offered to open the keep and pay 100 gold if I killed three Sarpa raiders, but I did not do it. In the quartermaster store are Hist sap jars with Jal-Veesa tree-minder knot, though the fort has no Hist. The gaoler Tsleel-Vaku refused me, and persuasion and illusion both failed. The cellar door is locked and needs a key, which Never-Writes-Twice keeps, or it can be picked. Something moans behind it. I do not know who is down there or why the order feeds them sap. I still carry the Unbounds Recipe for the Seal. Next: go to Lilmoth, take a boat to Bell Station and ask the divers which drowned tower is marked. Vanin is digging ahead of us. Later I could press Never-Writes-Twice or Jal-Veesa about the cellar.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 91, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink",